5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since it's the first day, we don't have any clues yet. Let's start by getting a feel for everyone. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they want to share?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm just so excited to play! I think we should all be super honest, but maybe a little bit of mystery makes it more fun, right? Hehe!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Honesty is a luxury we can't afford in this game. We should focus on observing patterns in how people respond to pressure.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Toshio. While Sakura's enthusiasm is charming, we must remain mindful that some among us are intentionally misleading. I will simply observe for now.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm with Mizuki! Let's just talk and see who seems suspicious. I'll do my best to help the village find the werewolf!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we're all on the same page about observing. @Toshio, you mentioned patterns under pressure; do you have a specific method in mind for how we should test each other?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe we could play a little game! Like, everyone tells us their favorite thing, and if they hesitate, they're the werewolf! Just kidding! Or am I? Teehee!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,A game like that is too simplistic. I'm more interested in how people react when they are accused or when they try to deflect suspicion onto others.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a sound approach, Toshio. The way a person defends themselves often reveals more than the actual content of their defense.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"That sounds a bit scary, but I'll be brave! I'm not the werewolf, so I'm not worried about being accused! Right, everyone?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Your confidence is refreshing, Kenji, but remember that the werewolf will likely say the exact same thing. Let's see if anyone is being too eager to blend in.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, is that what we're looking for? Someone trying too hard to be a good little villager? I'll be watching everyone very closely then!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Exactly. Over-eagerness can be a mask. I'll be paying close attention to who tries to steer the conversation away from themselves too quickly.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find myself wondering if the most silent among us are the ones most likely to be hiding something, or if the noise is the true distraction.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, does that mean I'm talking too much? I just want to make sure we're all friends while we figure this out! I'm not trying to distract anyone, I promise!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It's okay, Kenji. Your energy is natural. For now, let's just keep this open dialogue. I'll be analyzing everyone's logic as we move into the first night.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'll be dreaming of clues tonight! Good luck everyone, and try not to get eaten! Bye-bye!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I will be watching the results of the first night carefully. Let us see who the darkness chooses to target.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall retreat into my thoughts and await the morning. May we all find the peace of a safe night.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll be dreaming of a big victory for the village! See you all tomorrow morning!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
