36,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning, everyone. Now that the first night has passed, we need to be more focused. Did anyone notice anything unusual, or does anyone have information they can share?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I slept like a baby! But oh, I'm so curious! Did anyone have any spooky dreams or find out any secrets? Tell me, tell me!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I have information. I divined Kenji last night, and the result was clear: Kenji is the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a very bold and direct claim to make so early, Toshio. If you are indeed the Seer, we have found our target, but we must consider if this is a strategic lie.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! No way! Toshio, why are you lying about me? I'm a villager! I promise I'm not the werewolf! Everyone, please don't believe him!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"This is a critical moment. If Toshio is the Seer, the game ends today. But if he's the werewolf or possessed, he's trying to frame Kenji. @Toshio, why did you choose Kenji specifically for your first divination?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, this is getting intense! I didn't expect things to move so fast! @Toshio, you're so cool for just saying it out loud! But @Kenji looks so sad, are you really the bad guy?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I chose Kenji because his over-eagerness on Day 0 felt like a calculated attempt to appear innocent. My divination simply confirmed my suspicion. The facts are the facts.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Toshio is lying, he has essentially painted a target on his own back for the next night. However, if Kenji is the werewolf, he is now in a desperate position. @Kenji, your reaction is quite emotional.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Of course I'm emotional! I've been nothing but nice to everyone, and now Toshio is just pointing his finger at me for no reason! I'm a villager, I swear! Please, you have to believe me!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, emotional appeals aren't evidence. @Toshio, your logic is consistent, but we must be certain. If we execute Kenji and he's innocent, we lose a valuable human. However, the risk of letting a werewolf stay is higher.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I think we should trust Toshio! He seems so sure of himself, and it would be so exciting if we caught the werewolf on the very first day! Right, everyone?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I have no reason to lie. If I were the werewolf, I would be trying to blend in, not immediately identifying the target. The most logical move for the village is to execute Kenji now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The logic is compelling, but we must consider the Possessed. If Toshio is the Possessed, he could be protecting the werewolf by sacrificing a villager to gain our trust. Still, the evidence points heavily toward Kenji.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not the Possessed or the werewolf! I'm just a regular kid! Please, if you kill me, you're letting the real monster win! I'll do anything to prove I'm a villager!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It's time to decide. While Kenji's pleas are heartfelt, Toshio's claim is too direct to ignore. If we don't act now, we risk another death tonight. I'm leaning toward voting for Kenji.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm voting for Kenji too! Sorry, Kenji, but Toshio seems like he knows what he's talking about! Let's find out if we're right!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"The decision is clear. To ensure the safety of the village, we must act on the divination. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I have weighed the possibilities, and while I dislike the uncertainty, the risk of ignoring a Seer's claim is too great. I will cast my vote for Kenji.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"This is so unfair! I can't believe you're all listening to him! I'm not the werewolf! Please, just give me one more day! I'll prove it to you! I vote for Toshio!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
